<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12857" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποκληρ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>choose by lot from</i> a number, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.32
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἕνα ἐκ δεκάδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.25
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ πάντων τῶν λόχων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.8
				</span></i>
			: at Athens, <i>choose</i> or <i>elect by lot,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρυτάνεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					8.70
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.82
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιτοφύλακας ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					22.16
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be so chosen,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				25.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Marm.Par.</u>
				16
			</span></i>: hence, <i>choose at random,</i> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.114S.
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, much like
			
				Act.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.508
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.826f
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>allot, assign by lot,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώραν τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Caes.</u>
					51
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				4.2
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be allotted, fall to</i> one's <i>share,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Merc. Cond.</u>
					32
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.577
			</span></i>; <i>have allotted to one,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.214
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>eliminate by lot,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1298b26
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
